  title="Hearing Aid Firmware: Small Updates, Big Listening Gains"
  description="Your hearing aids have upgradable brains. Learn what firmware updates can do (better speech, steadier Bluetooth, longer battery life), how to update safely, and when to ask your audiologist for help."
